1, "mid": 5, "low": 2}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:02:33", "end": "00:03:06", "text": "It's me, your host, Ayaan. I DJ under the name Arsonist and I'm incredibly excited to present the first ever edition of a new show on the FBi Radio grid known as Drumskin. Under me right now we have the track called Dream by Special Guest DJ. And that kind of foreshadows that this show will have many Special Guest DJs coming."}, {"start": "00:03:22", "end": "00:04:09", "text": "It's going to be a weekly show where we're going to uncover percussive music of electronic and analog nature, illuminating drumming practices around the world and how they've been shaped by technology as well as tradition. So yeah, there's going to be so many ways in which people can interpret percussive music and today is the first ever show. I can't wait to take you along for the ride. and very excited to say this for the first time keep it locked and i mean that keep it locked you're gonna hear much more from me in a bit you're listening to drum skin on fbi radio 94.5"}, {"start": "01:10:11", "end": "01:12:04", "text": "Thank you all for tuning in. You are listening to Drumskin on FBi Radio 94.5, the first ever episode. To those of you who are listening with me, I salute you and thank you so deeply from the bottom of my heart for staying here with me through this. i hope you guys have all been enjoying right now under us is a seminal track of the meta right now which i believe to be devon rexie mix john t gasbred step john's iphone mix everyone in the world is playing this track right now uh it is it is so amazing a beautiful blend of post-rock and dub wise influences it can be done in a rave it can be done in a music gig you'd never know this is an incredible incredible track uh stay tuned for what is to come in drumskin over the next couple months whether that be on the fm waves or in real life uh thank you to everyone texting in on the text line 0435123945 i will be reading these out in a bit near 